:{"__typename":"IssueComment","databaseId":2251538342,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"josepharhar","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2ODE0Njc="},"id":"I_kwDOALaj486Q4Qx2","number":10520,"locked":false,"databaseId":2430667894},"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"domenic","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/617481?v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/domenic","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzQ4MQ==","name":"Domenic Denicola"},"id":"IC_kwDOALaj486GM7-m","url":"https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10520#issuecomment-2251538342","createdAt":"2024-07-25T23:00:29Z","authorAssociation":"MEMBER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"MutationObserver kind of uses microtask timing, but it uses a very special sort, with the compound microtasks. I wonder if the difference will be observable. I think it will, as it will set the \"mutation observer microtask queued\" agent-wide flag, which will impact the behavior of other web developer-created MutationObservers.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMutationObserver kind of uses microtask timing, but it uses a very special sort, with the compound microtasks. I wonder if the difference will be observable. I think it will, as it will set the \"mutation observer microtask queued\" agent-wide flag, which will impact the behavior of other web developer-created MutationObservers.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"2c70dd4e935aeea6c886179e26ad34bd587c9ba62a82ebed007634e7ebcd1c6c","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":f